  "Description": "<img width=\"25%\" src=\"https://gtif-ukif.github.io/gtif-ukif-client/assets/ucl-logo.webp\">\n\nA 1km daily SISR map of the UKIF area derived from the MODIS-MAIC product. Step-through each day to see how the PM2.5 changes over time and how much of the pollution originates in major urban areas or areas with large-scale industrial activities such as the Thames Estuary and the Rotterdam industrial areas.",
